ind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is LIVE! Play the Demo Now! 🐦","summary":"Bosses, the moment we have all been waiting for is finally here!Steam Next Fest is officially LIVE, and the free demo for The Golden Caravan is open to everyone right now on Steam! 🎰Whether you are a seasoned high roller or just a pigeon looking for some pasta and easy cash, now is your chance to pull up a chair at the table.What is waiting for you in the demoAvian Underworld Action: Build your deck and test out powerful synergies.Random Events: Face tricky choices where there is no right move, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:03:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691521","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1846651706673652","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"The Syndicate is Coming to Steam Next Fest! 🐦","summary":"Big news, bosses!The biggest event of the season is almost here, and we are thrilled to announce that The Golden Caravan is officially participating in the upcoming Steam Next Fest! 🎰Whether you have been following Charlie’s journey from the start or you are just stepping into the avian underworld for the first time, this is the perfect moment to test your luck.What to expect during Next FestDemo: Play through our card-battling roguelike mechanics, test out new Trinkets, Relics, and face unpredi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T09:07:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1843481262701699","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"The Golden Caravan is Heading to the devINITIVE Showcase!","summary":"The syndicate is taking over the spotlight. We are thrilled to announce that The Golden Caravan has been officially selected to feature at the devINITIVE Showcase on September 16th! 🃏Being chosen as part of this official selection is a huge milestone for our tiny team. It means the world to see our jazz-noir, avian underworld recognized alongside so many incredible indie projects.What Does This Mean for You?The showcase will feature fresh looks at our poker-roguelike mechanics, atmospheric art, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T13:35:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1843481262689358","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtests Start NOW!","summary":"THE HOUSE HAS NEW RULES, PIGEON.Word's out on the street... the Golden Caravan's had a little... renovation. New rooms, new faces, new ways to lose your feathers. We made a lot of changes to render life in our avian underworld even more mysterious, atmospheric, and playable.From one word to another...It is time for playtests! You can try the new version right here on Steam for PC and Mac. We want to hear your thoughts and get your feedback.Playtests run for whole week and ends on 16.09.2026.What","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T15:07:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262689358","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1836506165583577","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"The Paradox of the First 3 Seconds (And the Art of Wearing Many Hats)","summary":"One thing people don't often see about indie development is that making the game is only part of the job.At first, we were handling the art direction and narrative by ourselves. Fortunately, Damian – a great artist and close friend – joined the project. Between the two of us, we wear a ridiculous number of hats every single day: character design, animation, backgrounds, UI/UX, VFX, art direction, and even guiding the overall direction of the soundtrack (which is being composed by the incredibly ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T14:39:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165583577","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1836506165562772","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"1,000 Wishlists! The Underworld is Growing...","summary":"We just hit a massive milestone, and we owe it all to you. Golden Caravan has officially surpassed 1,000 wishlists on Steam!For a small indie team building a world out of jazz, grit, and feathers, seeing a thousand of you ready to step into our shady bird underworld means everything. Charlie might just be a pigeon, but with a flock this size behind him, the big bosses in this city should start looking over their shoulders.What’s Next on the Deck?We are working around the clock to make sure the f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T14:32:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1836506165549311","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #4 Why Poker is the Ultimate Language of the Underworld","summary":"Let's talk about why we chose poker as the heart of Golden Caravan. Sure, we could have made a standard fantasy deckbuilder where you throw fireballs or swing swords. But let's be honest - you can't exactly sit across a smoky table from a mob boss, look him dead in the eyes, and threaten him with a magic wand. It just doesn't fit the suit. In the shady underworld, poker isn't just a game. It is the ultimate language of survival. It is All About the Bluff In our city, nobody shows their true colo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T13:24:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165549311","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1833968530888584","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3 - Music is… the Godfather","summary":"Hop, Skip, and Fly Into the Caravan!I’m Maxi, the sound designer and composer behind everything you hear in Golden Caravan. This project has officially lodged itself in a burrow in my heart, and I’m here to tell you how I found the rhythm of this shadowed city. Talking About a Full Circle About a year ago, I saw the demo for Golden Caravan posted in a group for indie developers. I was blown away. The gameplay was addictive and the art was outstanding, but I noticed something: it didn't have an o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T15:43:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530888584","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1832700592789274","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2 - The Blueprint of the Underworld","summary":"Every operation has an origin story. Before the first card was dealt in the Golden Caravan, we had to decide what kind of city we were building and what kind of birds would run it. Today, we are opening the books to show you how we mixed classic noir, old-school mechanics, and a whole lot of feathers.🃏 The Core: Honoring a LegendWhen the team sat down to plot this job, we weren't just looking for inspiration. We were chasing a ghost.We are massive fans of Sword & Poker, a masterpiece from 2010 t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T14:36:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592789274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-1831432155565174","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1 - New Rules in the City","summary":"The word on the street is out. We listened to the whispers in the backrooms, took your feedback to heart, and decided it was time to give the Golden Caravan a serious tune-up. This isn't just a fresh coat of paint. It is a whole new way for the team to run the racket.The new demo is hitting the pavement on Steam.Here is the breakdown of the new operations!🃏 The Old Man’s Legacy: Grandpa’s RelicsCharlie’s grandfather never chased fortune at the card table without his lucky Relics... now it is Cha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-29T13:44:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155565174","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3169670-6339469370185696517","game_id":"steam-3169670","kind":"announcement","title":"The Boxing Room","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45172328/1d97e0983c79416531b673d7a943cc26fdd3e591.png The Boxing Room Ladieeees and Gentleman!!! Welcome, to The Golden Caravan Arena! This is not only a casino, it's also the perfect venue for your favorite boxing matches. {ST